{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b32d3bca-6a43-82e2-9b10-635b546207af",
  "created_at": "2026-01-18T12:37:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's still like glass out there, and I called yesterday about it too. The whole road is a sheet of ice, Kevin, and somebody has got to put sand down before somebody breaks a hip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hang on, let me get this down. Sorry, I don't have yesterday's call in front of me. Can I get your name and where you're located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosemarie Pellegrino. I'm at 78 Harrison Avenue, the Fort Adams side. You go down toward the water and it's the worst right at my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosemarie Pellegrino, 78 Harrison Avenue. And the problem is ice on the road itself, not just the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The road, the whole thing. We got that little dusting of snow Friday night, nothing, you couldn't even build a snowman, and then this cold snap came and it froze solid. Nobody touched it. I need sand. Sand, or salt, I don't care which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. A dusting on top of a hard freeze, that's the stuff that gets slick. So you're asking for sand on Harrison Avenue near your house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sand. I'm calling on a Sunday, I know that, I know City Hall is closed, they told me this is the number for the weekend. I got it off the paper by the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right number. This line is the one for after hours and weekends. Let me put it in as a request for sanding. Is there a cross street, or just down toward Fort Adams?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just down toward the Fort. You can't miss it, it shines. I had the mailman slide right past my box yesterday, he was holding on to the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ouch. Okay, so 78 Harrison, icy road, requesting sand, second call since yesterday. I'm writing that down so they see it was repeated."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good. Because yesterday the girl said somebody would come out and nobody came. Nobody. I sat at the window all afternoon. I have to go to the pharmacy tomorrow and I'm not walking on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I can't tell you what time a truck gets there, but I'll flag it so it goes to the crew supervisor first thing. Do you want a call back at a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me find my glasses. I have a stack of receipts clipped to the fridge and the number's on the, no, that's not it. Wait. It's 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151. Got it. Anything else on the street, any other spots that are bad?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner is bad too but mine is the worst. Just put sand. And tell them to come before dark, because it gets worse when the sun goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. It's in the system now, Mrs. Pellegrino. And if it gets worse or somebody gets hurt, call back here or 911 if it's an emergency."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Kevin. I'll be waiting by the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You take care. Stay inside and keep warm."
    }
  ],
